Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:01.67,Short,,0,0,0,,You can't tickle yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.67,0:00:02.18,Short,,0,0,0,,Your brain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.46,Short,,0,0,0,,sees it coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:04.50,Short,,0,0,0,,Every time you move
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.02,Short,,0,0,0,,it predicts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:05.72,Short,,0,0,0,,what the touch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.50,Short,,0,0,0,,will feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:07.06,Short,,0,0,0,,and turns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.16,Short,,0,0,0,,the feeling down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:09.28,Short,,0,0,0,,In one experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:10.20,Short,,0,0,0,,people tickled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:10.94,Short,,0,0,0,,their own hand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:12.29,Short,,0,0,0,,through a robot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:12.98,Short,,0,0,0,,When it copied them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:13.52,Short,,0,0,0,,instantly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.96,Short,,0,0,0,,it barely tickled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:15.76,Short,,0,0,0,,Add a delay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.44,Short,,0,0,0,,of a fraction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:17.12,Short,,0,0,0,,of a second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:17.80,Short,,0,0,0,,and the tickle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:18.87,Short,,0,0,0,,came back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:19.58,Short,,0,0,0,,The same trick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:20.90,Short,,0,0,0,,starts poke wars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:21.98,Short,,0,0,0,,In another study
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:22.64,Short,,0,0,0,,two people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:23.48,Short,,0,0,0,,took turns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:23.70,Short,,0,0,0,,pressing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.54,Short,,0,0,0,,each other's finger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.28,Short,,0,0,0,,trying to match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:26.08,Short,,0,0,0,,what they felt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.28,Short,,0,0,0,,Their own press
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.52,Short,,0,0,0,,always felt softer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:29.36,Short,,0,0,0,,so every turn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.28,Short,,0,0,0,,got harder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:30.98,Short,,0,0,0,,So go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:32.27,Short,,0,0,0,,try it right now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:32.90,Short,,0,0,0,,It won't work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:33.27,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.54,0:00:32.10,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to the sibling\Nwho always starts the poke war
